  "limits": [
    "Only previously ambiguous data-bearing requests from complete strong ordinary callers can be deferred. Missing alternative bodies or source disagreement remain unresolved.",
    "Bindings come from independent ordinary anchors and are frozen once. Actual data operands gate retries; neither deferred children nor descendants can add bindings or restart the data pass.",
    "Source refinements retain every raw version, reference kind, missing field and alternative. No automatic identity or ordinary fixed-byte threshold is changed.",
    "Release qualification compiles affected translation units against one consistent fixture ABI and links previously qualified archives with retained hashes. Current author translation units compile separately; this is not a full current-application rebuild.",
